Hexagonal architecture. Domain innermost, application defines ports, infrastructure provides adapters. Layer order DOMAIN, APPLICATION, INFRASTRUCTURE, CONTROL. No cross-layer dependencies. Port flow outbound to inbound. Severity: every CU is CRITICAL unless the CU content downgrades it explicitly.
